<title>TURKEY: Turk beet growers see 97/98 sugar output 2.05 mlnT.</title>
<headline>Turk beet growers see 97/98 sugar output 2.05 mlnT.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pankobirlik, an influential union of Turkish sugar beet cooperatives, expected 2.05 million tonnes of overall sugar production in 1997/98, up from 1.85 million tonnes in 1996/97, it said in a report.</p>
</text>
